WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.133 --> 00:00:01.868
Hi, everyone. This is Sally.

2
00:00:01.868 --> 00:00:06.673
I'm originally from Long Island, New York,
and I'm currently a fourth year student

3
00:00:06.673 --> 00:00:09.743
majoring in
Business Administration at Tepper

4
00:00:09.743 --> 00:00:12.912
with an additional major
in French and Francophone Studies.

5
00:00:12.912 --> 00:00:14.314
One of the experiences

6
00:00:14.314 --> 00:00:18.451
that really stood out to me at the Tepper
School was the Pro Track program.

7
00:00:18.451 --> 00:00:21.121
I went on this program
during my first year here,

8
00:00:21.121 --> 00:00:24.924
and at that time I honestly
didn't know much about the industry

9
00:00:25.091 --> 00:00:28.061
and even less about
what I really want to do in the future.

10
00:00:28.061 --> 00:00:31.865
So of course I was a little bit
intimidated and nervous going in.

11
00:00:31.865 --> 00:00:33.366
But what I soon realized

12
00:00:33.366 --> 00:00:38.104
is that everyone there, especially our
alumni and all the full time employees,

13
00:00:38.104 --> 00:00:42.542
were super open to talking to students
and sharing their advices with us.

14
00:00:42.542 --> 00:00:46.413
I ended up building very genuine
relationships with a lot of them,

15
00:00:46.413 --> 00:00:50.583
and especially with one alumni whom
I followed up with afterwards.

16
00:00:50.617 --> 00:00:52.619
Over time, we stayed in touch

17
00:00:52.619 --> 00:00:55.755
and when I actually started
going through my internship search

18
00:00:55.755 --> 00:00:59.559
and my full time recruiting process,
he gave me a lot of advice,

19
00:00:59.759 --> 00:01:04.197
help me mock interviews and offer
just a lot of opportunities in general.

20
00:01:04.197 --> 00:01:06.032
So even though the Pro Track program

21
00:01:06.032 --> 00:01:09.869
itself was just a short one day visit
to all the corporate offices,

22
00:01:10.270 --> 00:01:13.173
but for me it turned into something
much more long term.

23
00:01:13.173 --> 00:01:17.577
And this is just one of the many examples
and resources that Tepper offers

24
00:01:17.844 --> 00:01:21.014
for students to explore
their professional world in the future.

